### HotelOS Gateway / Swagger enhanced test scenarios
### Start the system first:
### docker compose up --build
### Swagger UI: http://localhost:8090/swagger-ui.html

### Gateway health
GET http://localhost:8090/api/gateway/health

### Gateway info
GET http://localhost:8090/api/gateway/info

### Gateway routes
GET http://localhost:8090/api/gateway/routes

### Auth login
POST http://localhost:8090/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Auth validate
GET http://localhost:8090/api/auth/validate?token=hotelos-demo-token

### Demo reset
POST http://localhost:8090/api/demo/reset

### Demo seed
POST http://localhost:8090/api/demo/seed

### Dashboard snapshot
GET http://localhost:8090/api/dashboard/snapshot

### Reception rooms
GET http://localhost:8090/api/reception/rooms

### Reception room by number
GET http://localhost:8090/api/reception/rooms/204

### Available double rooms on floor 3
GET http://localhost:8090/api/reception/rooms/available?roomType=DOUBLE&floor=3

### TS-01 check-in
POST http://localhost:8090/api/reception/check-in
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guestName": "Diana Otayeva",
  "roomType": "DOUBLE",
  "nights": 2,
  "preferredFloor": 3,
  "proximityPreference": "LIFT"
}

### Guests
GET http://localhost:8090/api/reception/guests

### Guest by room
GET http://localhost:8090/api/reception/guests/by-room/301

### Bill calculate
POST http://localhost:8090/api/reception/bills/301/calculate

### TS-02 check-out 204
POST http://localhost:8090/api/reception/check-out/204

### Housekeeping queue
GET http://localhost:8090/api/housekeeping/queue

### TS-03 start cleaning 204
POST http://localhost:8090/api/housekeeping/rooms/204/start

### TS-03 mark clean 204
POST http://localhost:8090/api/housekeeping/rooms/204/clean

### Housekeeping cleaners
GET http://localhost:8090/api/housekeeping/cleaners

### Cancel cleaning queue item
PATCH http://localhost:8090/api/housekeeping/queue/204/cancel

### Create room service order
POST http://localhost:8090/api/room-service/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomNumber": "301",
  "items": [
    {"name": "Coffee", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 4.50},
    {"name": "Sandwich", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 8.00}
  ]
}

### Get room service orders
GET http://localhost:8090/api/room-service/orders

### Get order by ID - replace ORDER_ID
GET http://localhost:8090/api/room-service/orders/ORDER_ID

### Next status - replace ORDER_ID
PATCH http://localhost:8090/api/room-service/orders/ORDER_ID/next

### Cancel order - replace ORDER_ID
PATCH http://localhost:8090/api/room-service/orders/ORDER_ID/cancel

### Room service charges for 301
GET http://localhost:8090/api/room-service/charges/301

### Report maintenance issue
POST http://localhost:8090/api/maintenance/issues
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomNumber": "115",
  "description": "Broken shower",
  "priority": "CRITICAL"
}

### Maintenance issues
GET http://localhost:8090/api/maintenance/issues

### Maintenance queue
GET http://localhost:8090/api/maintenance/queue

### Process next maintenance issue
POST http://localhost:8090/api/maintenance/queue/process-next

### Maintenance technicians
GET http://localhost:8090/api/maintenance/technicians

### Resolve maintenance issue - replace ISSUE_ID
PATCH http://localhost:8090/api/maintenance/issues/ISSUE_ID/resolve

### Cancel maintenance issue - replace ISSUE_ID
PATCH http://localhost:8090/api/maintenance/issues/ISSUE_ID/cancel

### Dashboard events
GET http://localhost:8090/api/dashboard/events

### Clear dashboard events
DELETE http://localhost:8090/api/dashboard/events

### Run official demo scenarios
POST http://localhost:8090/api/demo/run/ts-01

